#concept-box("Carry this into Chapter 5")[
  Chapter 4 has given you what the book says. Chapter 5 asks how it says it: two chapter titles that frame the whole story, a narrator who stays close to one man, a handful of objects that carry the argument, and a style built out of proverbs, jokes and Nigerian English. Style questions are the last five marks, and they are the ones candidates leave to luck.
]

